  message: "Part 1 (spec/schema contradiction) RECONCILED — confirmed: docs/schema.json `properties.sketch_precomputed: x-internal=true` (\"INTERNAL cache artifact, NOT a stability contract\"). Part 2 (mid-token truncation, embedding chunk-window path) is a NARROW residual that rarely fires (the hard char slices in `_build_context_chunk` only trigger when a 3-line window exceeds 800 chars — uncommon for config lines); the \"stray ]\" the filing cites is actually chunk-boundary selection, the same `_build_context_chunk` root cause as WI-gupod's cosmetic residual. Per the G9 Recommended close-out (owner 2026-07-21) the cosmetic `_build_context_chunk` cleanup is deprioritized (zero-external-consumer x-internal cache; not worth the cold-slice CI tax). Downgraded todo_hard -> todo_soft as the tracked home for that residual."  # e7ca
